    {"type":"text","id":"why_note_t","x":1600,"y":245,"width":220,"height":220,"text":"为什么只有 SWA 要切？\n\nSGLang SWA Pool\n物理页是 256 token\n\nFlashInfer / B12X\n主 SWA Kernel\n要求 64-token Page\n\nC4 本身就是 64，\n不走这次转换","originalText":"为什么只有 SWA 要切？\n\nSGLang SWA Pool\n物理页是 256 token\n\nFlashInfer / B12X\n主 SWA Kernel\n要求 64-token Page\n\nC4 本身就是 64，\n不走这次转换","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":101045,"version":1,"versionNonce":101046,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.28},

